# Wikiang only. Never reuse a community site's OAuth client or secrets.
# First apply migrations/003_wikiang_google_accounts.sql to the Wikiang database.
# Google Cloud: create a separate Web application OAuth client, branding = Wikiang / WIKIANG LLC.
# Authorized redirect URI: https://wikiang.org/wiki-auth/callback
# Scope requested by the application: openid only (no email/profile/Drive access).
# Configure these in wikiang/wikiang-secrets; never commit real values.
WIKIANG_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
WIKIANG_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# The login button stays unavailable until BOTH are set. Redeploy/restart after configuration.
# Keep existing WIKIANG_IP_HASH_SALT stable; anonymous revision attribution must not change.
# Real Google consent/callback needs one operator browser test after configuration.
